{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new, fully customizable Shopify section that closely matches the attached reference image. The section should present six Shopify services in a premium dark two-column card layout.
    
    SECTION DESIGN
    
    * Full-width section with a near-black background: #020509.
    * Content container maximum width: 1440px.
    * Desktop horizontal padding: 20px.
    * Mobile horizontal padding: 16px.
    * Top and bottom spacing should be adjustable in the theme editor.
    * Use clean, modern typography with strong visual hierarchy.
    * Do not add decorative graphics outside the cards.
    
    SECTION HEADER
    
    Center the header above the service cards.
    
    * Small uppercase eyebrow text: “WHAT WE DO”
    * Eyebrow color: orange #FF7A1A
    * Letter spacing: approximately 2px
    * Main heading: “End-to-End Shopify Solutions That Drive Results”
    * Heading color: #F7F7F7
    * Large, bold font with tight line height
    * Allow the eyebrow and heading to be edited in the Shopify theme editor
    * Add adjustable spacing between the heading and card grid
    
    SERVICE CARD GRID
    
    * Display cards in a two-column grid on desktop and tablet.
    * Display one card per row on mobile.
    * Gap between cards: approximately 28px horizontally and 24px vertically.
    * All cards should have equal height within each row.
    * Card background should match the section background or use a slightly lighter shade: #03070B.
    * Add a subtle 1px border: #242A31.
    * Border radius: 18px.
    * Desktop card padding: 38px.
    * Mobile card padding: 24px.
    * Cards should have generous empty space and a clean, minimal appearance.
    
    Each service card must include:
    
    1. A small icon container at the top
    2. Service title
    3. Short description
    
    ICON DESIGN
    
    * Icon container size: approximately 42px × 42px.
    * Rounded corners: 11px.
    * Use a subtle dark purple-to-brown gradient background.
    * Allow each block to use an uploaded image, SVG, Shopify icon, or emoji.
    * Keep icons centered inside the container.
    * Provide adjustable icon size.
    * Do not display a broken-image placeholder if no icon is selected.
    
    CARD TYPOGRAPHY
    
    * Title color: #F5F5F5.
    * Title size: approximately 20px.
    * Title weight: 650–700.
    * Description color: #AEB2B9.
    * Description size: approximately 15px.
    * Description line height: 1.55.
    * Keep approximately 14px between the icon and title.
    * Keep approximately 8px between the title and description.
    
    ADD THESE SIX DEFAULT SERVICE BLOCKS
    
    1. Icon: 🎨
       Title: Shopify Design
       Description: Conversion-focused designs that elevate your brand and improve user engagement.
    
    2. Icon: ⚙️
       Title: Shopify Development
       Description: Custom, scalable, and high-performance development built around your business goals.
    
    3. Icon: 🚀
       Title: Migration to Shopify
       Description: Smooth migration from other platforms with minimal downtime and clean execution.
    
    4. Icon: 📈
       Title: Conversion Optimization
       Description: Data-driven UX improvements that turn visitors into customers.
    
    5. Icon: ⚡
       Title: Performance Optimization
       Description: Speed and SEO enhancements that improve rankings and user experience.
    
    6. Icon: 💡
       Title: Growth Strategy
       Description: Strategic planning and execution to scale your Shopify store profitably.
    
    HOVER INTERACTION
    
    * On desktop hover, move the card upward by 3px.
    * Slightly brighten the border and add a soft orange or purple glow.
    * Keep the effect subtle and premium.
    * Use a smooth 250ms transition.
    * Disable movement on touch devices.
    * Respect the reduced-motion accessibility setting.
    
    SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR SETTINGS
    
    Make the section completely editable and compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0, including the Horizon theme.
    
    Add settings for:
    
    * Eyebrow text
    * Main heading
    * Heading maximum width
    * Heading alignment
    * Section background color
    * Card background color
    * Card border color
    * Heading, title and description colors
    * Accent color
    * Desktop and mobile section padding
    * Grid spacing
    * Card padding
    * Card corner radius
    * Card border thickness
    * Heading and text sizes
    * Enable or disable hover effects
    * Maximum content width
    
    Build every service as a repeatable Shopify block. Each block must support:
    
    * Icon or image upload
    * Emoji fallback
    * Service title
    * Description
    * Optional link
    * Optional accessible link label
    * Block reordering
    * Adding or removing service cards
    
    RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOUR
    
    * Desktop: two equal-width columns.
    * Tablet: two columns with reduced padding.
    * Mobile: one card per row.
    * Reduce the heading size smoothly on smaller screens.
    * Prevent text overflow and horizontal scrolling.
    * Maintain consistent card spacing and alignment.
    * Keep all tap targets accessible.
    
    Do not add a button, slider, carousel, pagination, shadows that are too strong, or additional content. The final section should closely match the attached reference: minimal, spacious, dark, professional, and conversion-focused.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-services-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background_color }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top_desktop }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_desktop }}px;
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-services-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_content_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.horizontal_padding_desktop }}px;
    padding-right: {{ block.settings.horizontal_padding_desktop }}px;
  }

  .ai-services-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-services-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_size }}px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_letter_spacing }}px;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.eyebrow_margin_bottom }}px 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-services-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_weight }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.heading_line_height }};
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.heading_max_width }}px;
  }

  .ai-services-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.grid_gap_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.grid_gap_horizontal }}px;
  }

  .ai-service-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background_color }};
    border: {{ block.settings.card_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding_desktop }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 250ms ease, border-color 250ms ease, box-shadow 250ms ease;
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_hover_effect %}
    @media (hover: hover) and (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .ai-service-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
        box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba({{ block.settings.accent_color | color_extract: 'red' }}, {{ block.settings.accent_color | color_extract: 'green' }}, {{ block.settings.accent_color | color_extract: 'blue' }}, 0.15);
      }
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-service-icon-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_container_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_container_size }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.icon_border_radius }}px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4A1D6E 0%, #5C3A2E 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.icon_margin_bottom }}px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-service-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-service-emoji-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-service-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_weight }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_margin_bottom }}px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-service-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.description_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-service-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-services-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-services-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: {{ block.settings.horizontal_padding_mobile }}px;
      padding-right: {{ block.settings.horizontal_padding_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-services-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_size }}px * 0.7);
    }

    .ai-services-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.eyebrow_size }}px * 0.9);
    }

    .ai-service-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding_mobile }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-services-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-services-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_size }}px * 0.6);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

